## Context

Child of 0700, second movement promised to the editor. For each stream
identified in 0702: what it establishes, and what it leaves open.

This is where the review stops being bibliometric. A citation count does not
say what a stream has shown; one has to read.

## Actions

1. Per stream, read the core works (≥ 50 citations) and the lineage milestones.
2. Write the synthesis: findings, live disagreements, open questions.
3. Report the disagreements rather than settle them by authority — the review
   maps, it does not decide.

## Invariants

- **Cite what we hold**: every cited work resolves to a local full text
  (`test_cited_works_available.py`), allowlist of unreachable ones maintained
  and purged when a text arrives. A literature review is the genre where this
  discipline slackens.
- A cited page is read on the page, never interpolated from an extraction.
- No text taken from the Œconomia manuscript — see 0705.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] One section per stream, findings and open questions distinguished
- [ ] Full-text guard green on the added bibliography
- [ ] Author editing pass
